{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4663a82519c963cb","name":"Lucrehulk-Class Droid Control Ship","source":{"id":"source:reference-4663a82519c963cb","title":"Lucrehulk-Class Droid Control Ship","revision":23840,"timestamp":"2024-10-07T13:09:32Z","sha256":"fbc29db369a5cca9f09ec7ad0c603c0f0f6115891239ab3ed8d8a8a78891df8b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23840","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lucrehulk-Class%20Droid%20Control%20Ship&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4663a82519c963cb","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The mainstay of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"}," space fleet, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lucrehulk"]},"-Class is a dangerous and heavily armored vessel that can be a threat to any ship that gets too close. These battleships come in two varieties: normal ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Lucrehulk"]},"-Class Battleships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lucrehulk-Class_Battleships"},", and Droid Control Ships.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Droid Control Ships are far more rare, and usually nestled behind a defensive screen where they could organize the Droid ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"}," and ground troops accordingly. Each Droid Control Ship houses massive command and control computers which broadcast control signals to all nearby Droid Troops and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", coordinating their actions and issuing commands. Without the Droid Control Ships, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," members of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"}," could not function.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Since the ships are usually not engaged in direct combat with enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},", the Droid Control Ships were given a lower priority for retrofitting than other ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Lucrehulk"]},"-Class Battleships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lucrehulk-Class_Battleships"},", and as such retain the same armament that they had around the time of the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Since the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Lucrehulk"]},"-Classes are converted freighters they carry no special systems designed specifically for combat, and have a number of design flaws that make them vulnerable to attack. These ships have extremely volatile reactors positioned near the cargo bays, and (as at least one Droid Control Ship at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," discovered) an attack from within a cargo bay can destroy an ent